# Step record over a one-bar clip (the head wraps): a key at the head; a
# chord of two keys tied into the next step with A#3; a rest (A#3) and a
# step back (F#3); SHIFT + white key 9 moves the head to step 9 and clears
# it; a note at MIDI IN there. REC let go, then PLAY/STOP.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--button 0.10:REC:1.5
--key 0.20:16:100:0.1
--key 0.40:0:90:0.3
--key 0.45:4:80:0.25
--key 0.50:5:100:0.05
--key 0.80:5:100:0.05
--key 0.90:1:100:0.05
--button 1.00:SEL:0.2
--key 1.05:14:100:0.05
--note 1.30:66:70:0.1
--button 1.80:PLAY/STOP
